WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,140
Miss Han, welcome to K1 base

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,140
Hello, Captain Lu

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,140
Your base is crowded and lively

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,140
At first glance, it seems that it is well managed.

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,140
If Miss Han likes it

6
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,140
You can join us K1

7
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,140
I'll arrange a good position for you

8
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,140
The base needs talents like you

9
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,140
Don't take it seriously

10
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,200
More and more people are joining

11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Food is very tight

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,230
If you want to eat well, go out and find it yourself.

13
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,230
I'll put on my feet later.

14
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,230
The rest is all yours

15
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:29,890
The first canteen for the people

16
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:30,890
This second canteen

17
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,890
Specializing in military personnel and managers

18
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:35,110
First time free

19
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,110
Three points will be deducted each of the last two times.

20
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:40,160
Poor conditions

21
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,160
Ms. Han will make do with it for a moment.

22
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,160
You are no longer a student official

23
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,160
Eat the same thing as everyone else every day, yes
